WEBVTT

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:36.070
"Bolero of Solitude and Melancholy"

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:09.770
I'll hold you until you fall apart.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:19.950
Hold you... fall apart...
hold you until... fall apart...

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.910
Lindo!

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.790
How long were you planning on sleeping?
It's a beautiful day.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.290
Now give me your laundry.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.800
Are you anemic?

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:46.980
I feel like I haven't slept very much...

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:52.980
It's okay--I'm with you.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.860
That much hasn't changed.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.070
Ritsuka!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:06.700
Don't cry, Ritsuka.
I'll talk to Mom for you, okay?

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.120
You will?

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.460
It's okay--I'm with you.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.550
Uh-huh!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:31.560
You always protected me.
You were my prince back then.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.360
But now...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.360
"But now" what?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.440
I'm not telling!

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.450
Hey!

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.000
What's this about? Who would--

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.000
Lindo? But why?

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:01.170
I...

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:05.470
I'll do whatever it takes
to protect you, Ritsuka.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:17.820
Lindo, is it true that you're an exorcist?

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:29.660
You know that Grandfather
studied folklore, right?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.040
Uh-huh.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.620
He was at the top of his field.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:39.090
Ironically enough,
his research wound up attracting

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.510
some rather sinister types.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.680
Sinister?

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.880
Yes.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:52.640
Devils and vampires, to be precise.
And... they killed Grandfather.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.270
But Grandfather was sick.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.900
Stricken with a deadly curse.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:04:59.900
Huh?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:04.700
I couldn't let you see him, no matter what.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.620
Grandfather's final moments a year ago...

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:12.620
He was no longer human. That was the curse.

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:18.540
Grandfather was worried about you
and Mom to the very end.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:22.710
He charged me with keeping the family safe.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.050
But...

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:27.180
Why you?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:32.180
I'd had this folklore,
this devil and vampire stuff,

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.430
hammered into me since I was young.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:41.440
And that my job was to protect you,
Mom, and the Tachibana family.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.320
And so you became an exorcist?

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.320
Did Mom know?

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:49.450
Yes. That's why she gave you that pendant.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.290
Potpourri repels evil.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.620
Why wouldn't you tell me?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.540
We were going to tell you everything

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.590
the day before your 17th birthday.

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:03.000
Then <i>they</i> came along.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.300
I can't believe it!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.050
Where's the forbidden grimoire?

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.350
Red eyes...

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:17.350
That was a vampire.
So was whoever took Mom, I'm guessing.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:22.400
But why? What reason could
they have for coming after Mom and me?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.400
According to Grandfather's research,

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.200
the devils' once-overwhelming
power has been dwindling,

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.620
and the vampires are seizing their opportunity.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.410
That's where the forbidden grimoire comes in.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.160
I see you've heard of it.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.540
Just the name.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:46.420
The grimoire is a book of magic;
whoever holds it controls the world.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:50.840
They're confident that the key
to knowing the grimoire's whereabouts

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.720
lies in the Tachibana family.

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.560
That's ridiculous! I have no idea!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.850
I don't know anything!

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:05.610
Where is the grimoire? You're the only key left.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:11.490
But... Sogami <i>does</i> know about the grimoire.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.870
Urie Sogami's not the only one.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:26.300
Urie Sogami, Mage Nanashiro,
Shiki Natsumezaka, and Rem Kaginuki:

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.800
They're devils.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.970
Devils? Come on.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:37.220
Rem's protected me, even risking danger himself.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.600
He said the ones who attacked me
and Mom were devil worshippers.

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.690
He wasn't protecting you!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:53.610
So where is the grimoire, really?

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:59.950
I don't know. What I <i>do</i> know
is that those sinister types

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.420
are after the grimoire,

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:07.380
which is why Grandfather
was killed and Mom abducted.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.470
Ritsuka... I want to keep you safe.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:22.480
Please believe me. You mean more
to me than anyone or anything else.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:29.230
Vampires... devils...

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:34.110
Was that a devil's doing, too? But...

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:41.540
Thank goodness... Oh, thank goodness, Rem...

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:58.180
♪ I want to believe he wouldn't hurt me ♪

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:11.650
♪ I want you to believe I'm the
only one who'll keep that smile safe ♪

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:35.880
Ritsuka...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:45.940
♪ I hear a voice: <i>this</i> is your destiny! ♪

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:51.110
♪ This love is all for you ♪

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:13.840
♪ I've come this far telling myself
she's my sweet sister, just one year younger ♪

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:20.300
♪ Yet I can't contain these feelings ♪

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:26.980
♪ And so I've decided:
I shall be an exorcist to protect you ♪

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:38.860
♪ Putting my all into atoning for the
mark of sin that flows through my body ♪

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.320
♪ Can you hear the voice of love? ♪

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:46.450
♪ Though I may not be forgiven ♪

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:52.880
♪ This feeling of true love tears me apart ♪

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:58.880
♪ I am your exorcist, yours alone ♪

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:06.640
♪ I swear unto eternity,
with no regard for my life ♪

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.080
I'll protect you--no matter what.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:43.590
Yes!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.020
Sorry, Lindo.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.890
I just have to see for myself.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.950
Um, is Rem in?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.330
Are you on the student council?

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.250
Rem!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.340
What do you want?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:25.720
Oh, I, uh... You've been
so kind about my mother...

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:32.180
But is that because you want the grimoire?

00:12:32.180 --> 00:12:36.650
The way I felt when you protected me--

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.690
I can trust that feeling, right?

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.900
Your brother dislikes me.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:48.870
As long as he's here,
there is nothing more I can do for you.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.200
Rem?

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.180
Master Rem!

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:10.560
Is Ritsuka Tachibana here?

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:11.520
Ritsuka?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.520
Have you seen her?

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:14.060
Who's that?

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:21.400
Um, Ritsuka's out today. Why do you ask?

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.820
I just saw her, in the third library.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.070
No matter.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.410
Oh, no!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.960
May the ancient benediction be upon you.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.420
Into your hands has been commended

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.420
a power that will endure unto eternity.

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:06.700
Rem... I guess I didn't get
to see anything for myself after all.

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.700
Master Rem?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:08.660
We've got a situation!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.620
Better hurry!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:14.250
Hang on a second!
What's this about President Rem?

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:16.410
He's looking for someone.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.580
Huh? Who?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:19.460
Someone Tachibana.

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.340
Like... Ri... Rika?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.210
That's the girl he summoned earlier.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.550
We've got to find her first
and take her to Master Rem!

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:27.590
You coming?

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.470
Oh, uh, not me.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.510
Let's hurry.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:31.510
Yeah.

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:35.640
What... what's going on?

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.730
Rem! What are you doing here?

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:48.900
This is a first...

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.030
Ritsuka? Ritsuka!

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:52.070
Azuna?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:54.990
Come.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.580
Huh? B-But--

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.500
Did you find her?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.460
I'll look over there.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:18.230
Show me the exalted way

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:19.810
to that which is lost.

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:34.490
Wait!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.830
Tell me something:

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:44.080
Are you... you and the
whole student council... are you--

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.170
Ritsuka!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:51.590
My brother?

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.770
Who... are you?

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.770
No! Let me go!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:23.170
What is this?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.380
So you <i>are</i> a devil?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.170
Is it true?

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:33.180
No! Stop!

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.640
Ritsuka!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:40.430
Lindo!

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:43.520
It's okay, Ritsuka! I'm with you!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.810
Big brother...

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:54.950
I specifically lured you here
with those impostors.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:59.830
Now show me what an exorcist is capable of.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.670
Stop! Lindo!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.090
Lindo!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.170
Lindo...

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.640
Stop that...

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:22.600
Stop!

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:26.270
Ritsuka!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.990
I never thought I'd be
using my power on a human...

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:45.250
By the sacred Name, obey me.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.120
O ye who are clad in darkness,

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.750
begone from here forevermore!

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.910
Rem!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.160
Is this...

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.330
Stay away from her!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:38.340
It's faint... but it is a splendid fragrance.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:42.930
I've ascertained this much;
let's call the day a success.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:01.910
Where have <i>you</i> been?

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.750
You saved me yet again.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.930
You really are my prince.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:25.310
Now do you see?
The student council is made up of devils.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:30.850
Still... I just don't think
Rem can be that evil.

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.440
You don't get it, do you?

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.190
That's right, I don't. Not at all.

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:39.110
And that's why I'm going
back to school tomorrow.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.110
Ritsuka!

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:45.580
I don't like being in the dark like this.
I want to see for myself.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.450
Try to stop me and I'll sneak out anyway.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:54.630
Here I thought you'd matured
quite a bit over the last year,

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.000
but you're just as bullheaded as ever.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.890
This is a ring of the Sacred Lux.

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.390
It's sure to keep you safe.

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:11.310
The Sacred Lux...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:15.270
If you want to go to school that badly,
I don't mind.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.610
Really?!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:20.320
However... I'll be going, too.
Starting tomorrow.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:23.910
What? Tomorrow? To <i>my</i> school?

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.160
To your school.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:28.990
<i>What</i>?

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:40.340
Everything is in motion.
I... I must find it before anyone else.

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.130
Find the grimoire--and yet...

00:20:49.770 --> 00:21:00.480
♪ Do you believe, with that soft heart of yours? ♪

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:11.830
♪ Even if that heart should be torn to pieces? ♪

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:23.720
By the sacred Name, obey me,
o ye who lurk in darkness.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.510
Begone from here forevermore!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.190
I <i>will</i> protect Ritsuka. You'll see.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.030
Why...

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.200
Why would you...

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:31.970
I'll show you what happens
when you defy a devil!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.100
Come on, already.
I'll show you something terrific.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:41.100
"B-Boying of Vainglory and Impulse"

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.850
Act 5: B-Boying of Vainglory and Impulse.
